style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> locations?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">loc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    file: loc.fileName,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    start: loc.textSpan.start,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    length: loc.textSpan.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"增量更新机制\">增量更新机制</h2><p>当文件内容变化时，你只需更新 Host 中的版本号和内容，Language Service 会自动增量更新内部状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function updateFile(fileName: string, newContent: string) {&#10;  const existing = files.get(fileName);&#10;  if (existing) {&#10;    existing.content = newContent;&#10;    existing.version++;&#10;  } else {&#10;    files.set(fileName, { content: newContent, version: 1 });&#10;  }&#10;  // Language Service 下次被调用时自动使用新版本&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> updateFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fileName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">newContent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> existing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> files.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fileName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (existing) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    existing.content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newContent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    existing.version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    files.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fileName, { content: newContent, version: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // Language Service 下次被调用时自动使用新版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种增量机制使 Language Service 能在大型项目中保持毫秒级响应——只有受变更影响的文件子图会被重新类型检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Language Service 是 TypeScript 编辑器智能的底层引擎，提供补全、诊断、定义跳转、引用查找等能力</li>\n<li>你需要实现 <code>LanguageServiceHost</code> 来告诉 Language Service 文件系统状态</li>\n<li>增量更新通过版本号驱动——改变版本号即可触发 Service 重新分析受影响的部分</li>\n<li>与 <code>ts.createProgram</code> 的区别：Program 是一次性快照，Language Service 是持续运行的增量服务</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>兄弟文档：<a href=\"compiler-host\">CompilerHost 自定义</a>——从另一个角度自定义 TypeScript 的文件解析行为</li>\n<li>跨库链接：<a href=\"../../typescript/configuration-and-tooling/compiler-options-and-strict-mode\">TypeScript 编译选项深入</a>——Language Service 的行为完全由 CompilerOptions 驱动</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Language Service 与 IDE 集成","id":"language-service-与-ide-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"创建 LanguageService","id":"创建-languageservice"},{"level":2,"text":"诊断信息获取","id":"诊断信息获取"},{"level":2,"text":"补全与智能提示","id":"补全与智能提示"},{"level":2,"text":"定义跳转与引用查找","id":"定义跳转与引用查找"},{"level":2,"text":"增量更新机制","id":"增量更新机制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"ts-morph 上层封装","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript-compiler-api/tooling/ts-morph"},"next":{"title":"CompilerHost 自定义与虚拟文件系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript-compiler-api/tooling/compiler-host"}}